Cathedral ward in General is one of those places that reveals a ton of new details if you have enough insight with 15 insight

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:22.360
church doctors are revealed to have eyeballs crowded around their lanterns and their sights become imbued with more power and

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.220
