If You have 40 insight, You are able to see the giant Cthulhu Monster that's been hanging off the church this entire time

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:37.429
That's the thing that grabs you when you try to pick up the hunter set in the courtyard

00:03:37.739 --> 00:03:43.548
Anyway once you've opened the main gate You can trigger Eileen the Crow's second appearance by opening the gate

