00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:08.059
Presumably after realizing that Gascoigne passed away

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:15.410
it's Eileen's job to put him down because as we saw with Gascoigne Hunters who go mad are a threat to everybody and

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:18.060
Hunters turn into the most horrific beasts

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.889
she gives you the "Shh"

00:04:19.889 --> 00:04:22.279
Gesture here and tells us to keep it a secret

00:04:22.669 --> 00:04:29.899
so naturally we reload our game and decide to blunder into the Tomb of Oedon here Eileen is patiently waiting to

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:32.720
