which is not a good thing because she does talk to you afterwards, killing Henryk unlocks his set for purchase in the dream and

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.750
Eileen will give you the approval gesture

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:56.780
Eileen is just one of the many NPCs in Cathedral ward though

